{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12202180","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12202180","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1220218001:1":{"text":"卢卡先生，你来的正好。酒保先生说……","source_cn":"卢卡先生，你来的正好。酒保先生说……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC4F3B65F92FE161","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:4:1220218002:0":{"text":"把刚才发生的事告诉了卢卡……","source_cn":"把刚才发生的事告诉了卢卡……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D1B3FA2EC52C02B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220218003:1":{"text":"那几个蠢货，我会教训他们的，不会让他们再闹笑话！","source_cn":"那几个蠢货，我会教训他们的，不会让他们再闹笑话！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17070E394D59E3A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220218004:0":{"text":"但就算这样也没法阻止他们喝酒吧，这个问题的本质原因，是锈锚港淡水供应不足呢。","source_cn":"但就算这样也没法阻止他们喝酒吧，这个问题的本质原因，是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF02937923057DB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220218005:0":{"text":"是因为锈锚港刚刚解封吗？还是净水管道出了故障呢？。","source_cn":"是因为锈锚港刚刚解封吗？还是净水管道出了故障呢？。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA6D38EBFCF7E855","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","doc